@startuml
|Configuration|
start
:Load colors, illumination and simulation assumptions;
|Spectral engine|
:Load CIE D65 SPD and CIE 1931 2° CMFs;
:Fit parameterized L2/L3 LED SPD;
:Reconstruct smooth bounded target reflectance;
:Apply virtual absorbance print transfer;
:Integrate under each SPD to XYZ, Lab and xy;
:Compute ΔE00, ΔL, ΔC, ΔH, wavelength and purity;
|Simulation|
:Map ΔE00 to assumed confusion probabilities;
:Monte Carlo inventory under perfect/error recognition and capacity cases;
:Calculate alternative modeled mass and emissions estimate;
|Evidence|
:Write CSV tables, metadata and figures;
:Persist API-created records in SQLite;
stop
@enduml
